"fee set forth above for said use increased by 5%. If this Agreement does not set forth an applicable fee that" +
"equates to said use, the fee shall be the highest fee set forth in this Agreement. Wiley and Licensor further" +
"agree that fees calculated in accordance with this Paragraph represent reasonable compensation for the loss" +
